---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Board AI Name Standard Advisory | Lozen Advisory" description="Board and executive advisory using the Name Standard to test whether AI-assisted work can defensibly carry a human name, approval, or professional judgment.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Name Standard Advisory</div>
    <span class="pill">Human Attribution</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Name Standard℠ Advisory</h1>
    <p class="sub">The Name Standard℠ tests whether the answer to who was accountable would actually hold up.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Request a Name Standard Review →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A human name is not evidence of human accountability.</h2>
      <p>AI-assisted work may carry an executive approval, professional judgment, client communication, regulatory representation, or enterprise record.</p>
      <p>Lozen Advisory tests whether the named person had the conditions required to make that attribution real and defensible.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Time allocation</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Review capacity and tools</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Information access</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Documentation infrastructure</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Authority and escalation</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Formal right of refusal</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div><h3>Attribution review</h3><p>Identify where AI-assisted work is carrying a human or institutional name.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Capacity test</h3><p>Assess whether reviewers had the time and tools required for meaningful oversight.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Information test</h3><p>Determine whether the named person had access to the evidence needed to decide.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Documentation test</h3><p>Evaluate whether the review and decision can be reconstructed later.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Authority test</h3><p>Confirm who could approve, constrain, escalate, or stop the work.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div><h3>Refusal test</h3><p>Determine whether the named reviewer had a real right to decline or withhold sign-off.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear advisory process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Identify</h3><p>Map the AI-assisted decisions, outputs, or approvals carrying human attribution.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Test</h3><p>Evaluate each attribution against the Name Standard℠ conditions.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Locate</h3><p>Find where authority, evidence, capacity, or refusal rights break down.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Brief</h3><p>Deliver the findings and the governance actions leadership should consider.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Is this a software audit?</h4><p>No. It is a governance review of human attribution, authority, evidence, review capacity, and refusal rights.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What kinds of work can be reviewed?</h4><p>Executive approvals, professional advice, client communications, regulatory submissions, board materials, reports, and other AI-assisted work.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What does the review produce?</h4><p>A clear view of where attribution is defensible, where it is ceremonial, and what leadership must resolve.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="name standard advisory" selectedService="Name Standard Advisory" />
</BaseLayout>
